    "scope": "Resolve the ten request, resource, lifecycle and naming boundary findings; preserve the concurrently committed continuation fix.",
    "issues": [
      {
        "issue": 1,
        "result": "Prefill victim selection is in EvictionPlanner; PrefillEndpoint holds the existing ownership lock across planning and State exact revalidation/replacement. State exposes facts and counts without selecting victims."
      },
      {
        "issue": 2,
        "result": "Acquirer reads the canonical PreemptionRegistration result Future. Removed RESOLVED disposition and resolutionCompletion. Outbound responsibility remains separate from REQUEST_END / DELIVERY_RESUMED and actual Decode release proof."
      },
      {
        "issue": 3,
        "result": "DeliveryTransaction owns preparation, atomic commit and resource handoff/rollback. Strategies own prediction and Scheduler request-failure progression. Early RPC callbacks stay gated until resources are released."
      },
      {
        "issue": 4,
        "result": "ZookeeperMasterElectService captures one immutable LocalNodeIdentity. MasterStatusService shares it. Enabled-election validation and standalone raw-port behavior are preserved."
      },
      {
        "issue": 5,
        "result": "BalanceContext renamed RequestContext; LBStatusConsistencyService renamed MasterStatusService; EngineGrpcService renamed WorkerStatusRpcClient. Java callers, tests, benchmark tool and existing guides migrated, with no compatibility wrappers."
      },
      {
        "issue": 6,
        "result": "Context owns terminal event acceptance, retained admission evidence and preemption result precedence. Scheduler coordinates exact Endpoint ledger reconciliation and executes a temporary decision through existing effects. Removed duplicate retained-terminal acceptance and terminalWins."
      },
      {
        "issue": 7,
        "result": "Context classifies awaitsDelivery. Repository only counts via pendingDeliveryRequestCount. Preserved QUEUED/ROUTING/READY_TO_DELIVER semantics; IMMEDIATE and delivery handoff are excluded."
      },
      {
        "issue": 8,
        "result": "Runtime holds AbstractRequestScheduler and invokes its closePlacement hook; QUEUE overrides it. Removed production type checks/casts and preserved fault-isolated shutdown order."
      },
      {
        "issue": 9,
        "result": "Removed constant-true EngineCancelChannel.isSupported(DecodeEndpoint) API and gate. Real Prefill cleanup capability discovery and UNSUPPORTED ACK handling remain."
      },
      {
        "issue": 10,
        "result": "Removed duplicate QueuedRequestScheduler.priorityOrdering field and impossible Prefill-null RequestRoute getter fallbacks. Test fixtures now supply the required Prefill assignment."
      }
    ],
